---
import ParallaxContainer from './ParallaxContainer.astro';
import graphic from '../../assets/ui/shapes/orange-blurs.svg?url';
---

<section class="about-us" aria-labelledby="about-us-heading">
  <div class="intro">
      <h2 id="about-us-heading">More About Us</h2>
      <p>
      Founded in 2017, UNSW DataSoc is Australia’s first and largest student data science society. We bring together mathematicians, econometricians, computer scientists and anyone curious about data. 
      </p>
      
      <p>
      Each year, we run events that support students in their studies and careers and also host social events open to everyone at UNSW.
      </p>
  </div>

    <div class="graphic-layer" aria-hidden="true">
            <img src={graphic} alt="" draggable="false" />
    </div>

</section>


<style>
  .about-us {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    min-height: 55vw;
    overflow-x: clip;
  }

  .intro {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    width: 41%;
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-syne), sans-serif;
    font-size: 30px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #ed4669;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  p {
    font-family: var(--font-inter), sans-serif;
    position: relative;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 2.5;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-align: left;
    color: #ed4669;
  }

  .graphic-layer {
    position: absolute;
    top: 5;
    right: -1;
    width: 58%;
    z-index: -1;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .graphic-layer img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

</style>

